        "created_at": "2015-03-09T00:58:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Regarding the GG stuff, the only info I heard was what I readon on Brianna Wu's twitter feed, but there was <a href=\"http://www.bostonglobe.com/metro/2015/03/08/brianna-appears-pax-east-videogame-convention/hEzlyb5ggIf03vKycUa2aL/story.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">an article in today's Boston Globe </a>that discussed what happened.&nbsp; Kind of bummed now that I didn't make it to her podcast panel on Friday night just to show support (but I was feeling like the Walking Dead at that point in the evening, so I had to crash).</p>",
